#: ../../quickstart.md:1
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../quickstart.md:3
msgid ""
"目标：几分钟内让 sapic 跑起来，并传上第一张图。只想看看效果就走 Docker，要改代码或长期运行就走 "
"源码方式；systemd、nginx、HTTPS、数据库选择这些生产细节见[部署与运维](deploy.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Goal: get sapic running and upload your first image within a few minutes."
" If you only want to look around, use Docker; if you need to change code "
"or run it long term, run it from source. Production details such as "
"systemd, nginx, HTTPS and database choice are in [Deployment and "
"operations](deploy.md)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:6
msgid "方式一：Docker（最快）"
msgstr "Option 1: Docker (fastest)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:12
msgid ""
"镜像里已经包含构建好的前端、nginx、gunicorn 与独立的调度进程（supervisor 统管，见 "
"[容器与编排](deploy.md)），浏览器打开 `http://<服务器IP>/` 就是站点。 SQLite 库、上传文件与第三方钩子都在 "
"`sapic-data` 卷里，删容器不丢数据。"
msgstr "The image already bundles the built front end, nginx, gunicorn and a "
"standalone scheduler process (managed by supervisor, see [containers and "
"orchestration](deploy.md)): open `http://<server-ip>/` in a browser and "
"you are on the site. The SQLite database, uploaded files and third-party "
"hooks all live in the `sapic-data` volume, so recreating the container "
"keeps your data."

#: ../../quickstart.md:16
msgid "换成自己的域名、并换掉内置密钥："
msgstr "Point it at your own domain and replace the built-in secret:"

#: ../../quickstart.md:23
msgid ""
"端口冲突时用 `SAPIC_PORT=8080 docker compose up -d`。要用 PostgreSQL（多进程 / "
"多副本）或部署到 Kubernetes，看[容器与编排](deploy.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If port 80 is taken, use `SAPIC_PORT=8080 docker compose up -d`. For "
"PostgreSQL (multiple workers / replicas) or Kubernetes, see [Containers "
"and orchestration](deploy.md)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:26
msgid "方式二：源码运行"
msgstr "Option 2: Run from source"

#: ../../quickstart.md:45
msgid "开发时访问 <http://127.0.0.1:5173>（有热更新）。只起后端的话，9514 上只有 JSON 接口，没有页面。"
msgstr ""
"During development open <http://127.0.0.1:5173> (hot reload included). If"
" you start the backend only, port 9514 serves JSON APIs and no pages."

#: ../../quickstart.md:47
msgid "传第一张图"
msgstr "Upload your first image"

#: ../../quickstart.md:49
msgid "用刚建的管理员账号登录，进后台 `/admin/setting` 按需打开注册、匿名上传，调整单文件上限；"
msgstr ""
"Sign in with the administrator account you just created, then open "
"`/admin/setting` to enable registration or anonymous uploads and adjust "
"the per-file limits;"

#: ../../quickstart.md:50
msgid "首页拖拽或粘贴图片上传，点结果里的地址确认能打开；"
msgstr ""
"drag or paste an image on the home page, then open the resulting URL to "
"confirm it works;"

#: ../../quickstart.md:51
msgid ""
"「设置 → 访问令牌」建一枚只含「上传图片」的 PAT —— PicGo / Typora / 脚本都用它， "
"逐项配置见[快捷上传](usage.md)。"
msgstr ""
"create a PAT with only the `upload` scope under Settings → Access tokens "
"— PicGo, Typora and scripts all use it; per-client setup is in [Quick "
"upload](usage.md)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:54
msgid "接下来"
msgstr "Next steps"

#: ../../quickstart.md:56
msgid "部署到自己的服务器（systemd、nginx、HTTPS、备份）：[部署与运维](deploy.md)"
msgstr ""
"Deploy to your own server (systemd, nginx, HTTPS, backups): [Deployment "
"and operations](deploy.md)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:57
msgid "每个配置项与站点设置的含义：[配置](config.md)"
msgstr ""
"What every config option and site setting means: "
"[Configuration](config.md)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:58
msgid "从 v1 升级：[从 v1 迁移数据](migrate-v1.md)"
msgstr "Upgrading from v1: [Migrating data from v1](migrate-v1.md)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:59
msgid "起不来、传不上：[常见问题](faq.md)"
msgstr "Won't start or won't upload: [Troubleshooting](faq.md)"

